# Commit and deploy after changes

When the user asks you to make a change to this project, finish by:

1. Committing with a clear message (only when they asked for a change or explicitly asked to commit)
2. Pushing to the remote branch
3. Deploying production with `npx vercel --prod --yes`

Do this at the end of the same turn unless deployment is blocked (e.g. build failure). Report the commit hash and production URL.
